# Export to JSON

* In the toolbar click *Export*, then select *JSON*.
* Select the items to export and click *Next*.

<figure><img src="/files/XzLKciH7cLMkb1ibHxx1" alt="" width="563"><figcaption><p>Choose which entities to export</p></figcaption></figure>

* A download will begin with the JSON file

